93","id":4590574043,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEZ6Z2w","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-01T07:51:01Z","updated_at":"2026-06-01T07:51:01Z","body":"`PlaceholderScriptInstance` is an error tolerant container, so we need to be careful to write this code in a very defensive manner.\r\nTherefore I do believe the type check would be better placed on demand in `get`. Reason being: placeholder script instances accept and safe all values for scripts which have a parser error. This happens through `property_set_fallback`. When a script is fixed later the values set while it had errors are maintained. We can't do type checking in `property_set_fallback` which means wrong values could still leak into typed OP-Codes.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4590574043/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]